        "content": "## Pin an image to Pinterest\n\n### How it works\n\n1. Runs when you click Execute Workflow.\n2. Publishes a post to Pinterest via the SocialRobot API.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Install the SocialRobot community node and connect your SocialRobot API credential (API key: socialrobot.io, Scheduler -> API Keys).\n- [ ] Select your Pinterest account in the Publish to Pinterest node.\n- [ ] Set your Pinterest board ID in the Publish to Pinterest node.\n- [ ] Replace the sample media URL with your own public image or video URL.\n- [ ] Replace the example caption in the Publish to Pinterest node with your own text.\n\n### Customization\n\nReplace the example content, then run the workflow whenever you want to post. Run it any time to post, or connect a Schedule Trigger to automate it.",
